Author:     John Bieling <john@thunderbird.net>
AuthorDate: Fri Dec 13 16:45:46 2024 +0000
Commit:     John Bieling <john@thunderbird.net>
CommitDate: Fri Dec 13 16:45:46 2024 +0000

    Bug 1913580 - Part 2: Update SpaceTracker to store the full SpaceTabProperties object instead of just a URL. r=mkmelin

    Part 1 added the possibility to specify a `SpaceTabProperties` object
    instead of a URL, but only the URL was actually stored. This patch
    updates the SpaceTracker to store the full object.

    This patch does not yet add any new functionality.

    We do adjust the deprecated spacesToolbar API to no longer store the URL
    as part of its SpaceButtonProperties but only in the new
    SpaceTabProperties. This might have caused issues in the past, when an
    add-on used the spaces API and (!) the spacesToolbar API to
    create/update the same space.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D229880

